              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "The compiler refused a program that is valid C, and said itself that it has not built the construct yet. A gap on a to-do list rather than a bug."
              },
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
